// Directory data for the prompting guides, inherited by every page beside it.
//
// These pages are authored in Markdown, which carries no chrome of its own: base.njk drops
// `content` straight into `<main>`, and the stylesheet styles the `.prose-ki` component rather
// than bare `p`/`ul`/`li`. A Markdown page therefore rendered edge-to-edge with no measure until
// fourteen of these pages pasted the wrapper into their own bodies and the rest did not.
//
// Setting the layout here rather than in each frontmatter means a prompting guide is styled
// because of where it lives, so a page added later cannot ship unstyled by omission.

{
  layout: 'layouts/page.njk',
  section: 'prompting'
}
